#. 記憶喪失の可能性を示しているのは、
#. あの集合写真だけじゃないんだ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Those photos aren't the only things that point to the\n"
"possibility of memory loss."
msgstr ""

#. この<CLT 3>ＤＶＤ<CLT>もだよ。
#. これが、もう１つの根拠なんだ。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This <CLT 3>DVD<CLT> does the same thing."
msgstr ""

#. それって…い、いやらしいヤツじゃ…！
#. な、ないでしょうね！？
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You're not g-gonna show us something indecent, are\n"
"you!?"
msgstr ""

#. …そ、そうじゃなくって、
#. ここに映ってるのは…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...N-No, it's nothing like that!"
msgstr ""

#. ボク達みんなと…希望ヶ峰学園の学園長との…
#. <CLT 3>面談の様子<CLT>だったんだ。
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's a video of all of us, <CLT 3>being interviewed<CLT> by the\n"
"Hope's Peak Academy headmaster."
msgstr ""

#. み、みんなって…誰の事…？
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "When you say \"all of us\" you mean..."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、朝日奈さんもだよ。
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I mean all of us. Including you."
msgstr ""

#. ウソだよ！　私は面談なんてやってないもん！
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You lie! I never did any kind of interview!"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ、ウソじゃないわ。
#. そのＤＶＤを見ればわかるはずよ…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No, it's not a lie. Just watch the DVD and you'll see\n"
"for yourself."
msgstr ""

#. あなたも…学園長と面談していたのよ…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The headmaster did, in fact, interview you."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ホ、ホントなの…？　冗談じゃなくて…？
msgctxt "0012 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What are you saying!?"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、覚えてないんだね？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I didn't imagine you would remember."
msgstr ""

#. お、覚えてないって言うか…
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It's not about whether or not I remember...!"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だからって…信じろって言うの？
#. そんな…記憶喪失なんて…！
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You expect me to believe all this? That I...I lost my\n"
"memory somehow...!?"
msgstr ""

#. だが、反論材料がないなら、
#. 信じる他あるまい…
msgctxt "0016 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, we don't have any way to refute it, so we have\n"
"no choice but to accept it as reality."
msgstr ""

#. つーか、十神っちはなんで余裕なんだって！？
#. わかってんのか、記憶喪失だぞ！？
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"How can you say that!? We're talking about living,\n"
"breathing amnesia here!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事より、他に気になる事がある。
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"To be honest, I have something else on my mind right\n"
"now."
msgstr ""

#. そんな事よりって…
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Something else...?"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Một ý định khác sao...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. そのＤＶＤに録画されているのは、
#. 俺達と学園長との面談だと言ったな？
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You said the DVD contains recordings of us being\n"
"interviewed by the headmaster, right?"
msgstr ""

#. それは、どんな内容の面談だったんだ？
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What were the interviews about?"
msgstr ""

#. 学園長は…ボク達１人１人に、
#. 同じ質問をしてたんだ…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The headmaster sat each of us down, one at a time, and\n"
"asked us the same question..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>『この学園での一生を受け入れるか？』<CLT>
#. それが学園長の質問だよ…
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"He asked us if <CLT 3>we could accept the idea of spending\n"
"the rest of our lives in this school<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. な、何よ…その質問…！
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What kind of qu-question is that...?"
msgstr ""

#. それで？　俺達はなんと答えていた？
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And? How did we answer?"
msgstr ""

#. そんなん、断るに決まってんだろ！
msgctxt "0026 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "We'd say no, obviously!"
msgstr ""

#. いや…それが……
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Actually..."
msgstr "Thực ra thì..."

#. みんな…受け入れてたんだ…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "We all...said we could."
msgstr ""

#. それは、ボクもそうだった…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Even me..."
msgstr ""

#. ボク自身が、ボク自身の声で、
#. ここでの一生を受け入れるって答えてたんだ…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I heard myself say yes, I could spend the rest of my\n"
"life at this school."
msgstr ""

#. な、なんで…！？
#. なんで…受け入れてんのよ…ッ！？
msgctxt "0031 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Wh-Why!? Why would you say yes to s-something like\n"
"that!?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクにも、わからないよ！
#. だって覚えてないんだ！！
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I don't know! I don't remember a thing!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、それは他のみんなも一緒のはずよ？
#. 誰も覚えていないんでしょう…？
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "The same goes for everyone else? Nobody remembers...?"
msgstr ""

#. ここでの一生を受け入れた事も…
#. 学園長との面談さえも…
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You don't remember choosing to live here forever. Or\n"
"even talking to the headmaster about it at all..."
msgstr ""

#. お、覚えてないも何も…
msgctxt "0035 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It doesn't matter if I remember or not."
msgstr ""

#. 記憶喪失とか…ここでの一生を受け入れたとか…
#. いきなり言われても…
msgctxt "0036 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Even if I bought the whole amnesia thing, the idea\n"
"that I would want to live here forever..."
msgstr ""

#. そんなん、信じろって方が無茶だべ！！
msgctxt "0037 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "That's just insane! How can I believe that!?"
msgstr ""

#. 無茶でもなんでも、信じない事には話が進まないわ。
#. そうよね…？
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Insane or not, we can't move forward until you accept\n"
"it. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだね。<CLT 3>正解<CLT>だからね。
msgctxt "0039 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "You sure are! Cuz it's <CLT 3>all true<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. はぁあああああああッ！？
msgctxt "0040 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Whaaaaaat!?"
msgstr "Cái gìiiii!?"

#. バカバカしい結論だけど…
#. それが真実なら認めるしかないわ。
msgctxt "0041 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I know it sounds absurd, but...if it's the truth,\n"
"there's nothing we can do about it."
msgstr ""

#. それ以外に、進む道はないという事か…
msgctxt "0042 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Indeed. We only have one path in front of us."
msgstr ""

#. じゃ、じゃあ…本当に…？
msgctxt "0043 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Th-Then...we really...?"
msgstr ""

#. そう！　みんな仲良く記憶喪失なの！！
msgctxt "0044 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Yup! You all totally lost your memory at the same\n"
"time!"
msgstr ""

#. なんか…頭痛くなってきた…
msgctxt "0045 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "This is all...making my head hurt..."
msgstr ""

#. しかも、ただの記憶喪失じゃないはずだ。
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And this isn't like some normal kind of memory loss."
msgstr ""

#. お前が…ボク達の<CLT 3>記憶を奪った<CLT>んだろ…？
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You <CLT 3>stole those specific memories<CLT> from us, didn't\n"
"you?"
msgstr ""

#. あっちゃー！　バレちゃった！？
msgctxt "0048 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Oopsie! You figured that part out too, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 当然でしょ。全員が同時に記憶喪失なんて…
#. そんな偶然がある訳ないわ。
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Of course. There's no way we would all just happen to\n"
"get amnesia at the same time."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…記憶を奪ったって…
#. そんなの…どうやって…？
msgctxt "0050 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "B-But...how could someone just s-steal our memories?"
msgstr ""

#. どうやって…？
msgctxt "0051 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "How...?"
msgstr ""

#. いやいやいや！
#. そんな事はどうだっていいんだよ！
msgctxt "0052 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Come come come, that hardly matters right now!"
msgstr ""

#. 催眠術って言えばリアリティーがあるの！？
#. 開頭手術で脳をいじったって言えば納得するの？
msgctxt "0053 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If I said it was hypnotism, would you believe me? Or\n"
"we opened up your skulls and messed with your brains?"
msgstr ""

#. そうじゃないでしょ！？
#. 問題は“そこ”じゃないはずだよ！！
msgctxt "0054 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Would you really believe anything I said? How it\n"
"happened doesn't matter right now!"
msgstr ""

#. 問題なのは、俺達の<CLT 3>“どんな記憶”<CLT>を奪ったのか…
#. そういう事だな？
msgctxt "0055 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What matters is figuring out <CLT 3>what memories<CLT> you took\n"
"from us. That's what you're trying to say, right?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…さすがは十神クンだね…
msgctxt "0056 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu! I knew I could count on you!"
msgstr ""

#. 学園長との面談…集合写真の撮影…
#. それらの記憶だけを奪ったとは考えられん。
msgctxt "0057 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The interview with the headmaster, taking that group\n"
"photo... Those can't be the only memories we lost."
msgstr ""

#. そこには、何か目的があったはずだ。
#. 俺達の記憶を奪った目的がな…
msgctxt "0058 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There must have been a purpose to it all. A reason for\n"
"taking away our memories..."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、目的はあるよ！
#. 例の<CLT 3>“動機”<CLT>にも関係している目的がね！
msgctxt "0059 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Of course there was a purpose! It all has to do with\n"
"the original <CLT 3>motive<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>例の動機…って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The original motive...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お前が、ボク達に殺し合いをさせる為に用意した…
#. あの動機の事か？
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You mean the \"motive\" you came up with to try and get\n"
"us to all kill each other?"
msgstr ""

#. あれが、奪われた記憶とも関係しているの？
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That has something to do with the memories you stole\n"
"from us?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…そうなんだけどね…
msgctxt "0063 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu! It sure does!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、まだ内緒なの！！
msgctxt "0064 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "But that part's still a secret...!"
msgstr ""

#. だって、忘れてもらっちゃ困るんだけど、
#. これって<CLT 3>“戦刃むくろ殺しの学級裁判”<CLT>なんだよね！
msgctxt "0065 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I'm sure it's not easy, but let's all focus on\n"
"the <CLT 3>class trial for the murder of Mukuro Ikusaba<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり…まずは戦刃むくろ殺しの犯人を
#. 突き止めろという事か…
msgctxt "0066 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Okay, so you want us to figure out who killed her\n"
"before we do anything else..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら、そうするまでだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So until we do that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どっちにしろ…ボク達はすべての謎を
#. 明らかにしなくちゃならないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well either way, we have to explain every last\n"
"remaining mystery.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それなら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr "Nếu vậy thì..."

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろを殺した犯人…黒幕の正体…
#. まずは、それを明らかにしてやる！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The one who killed Mukuro—the true mastermind...\n"
"That's what we need to expose!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
